<%- include('partials/head') %><%- include('partials/nav') %>
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-backdrop"></div><div class="wrap hero-content">
    <div class="eyebrow light-eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> YOUR NEXT STORY STARTS HERE</div>
    <h1>India is calling.<br><em>Let's make it yours.</em></h1>
    <p>From Himalayan hideaways to coastal escapes and soulful pilgrimage journeys — find a trip that feels like you.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/packages">Explore holidays <span>↗</span></a><a class="btn btn-glass" href="/custom-trip">Plan a custom trip</a></div>
    <div class="hero-trust"><span><b>30+</b> regions to explore</span><i></i><span><b>60</b> sample trip ideas</span><i></i><span>Made around you</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-note"><span class="note-icon">✦</span><div><strong>Travel your way</strong><small>Flexible trips, personal planning</small></div></div>
</section>
<section class="quick-search"><div class="wrap search-panel"><div><span class="search-icon">⌕</span><div><small>START EXPLORING</small><strong>Where would you like to go?</strong></div></div><form action="/packages" method="get"><input name="q" placeholder="Try Manali, Kerala, pilgrimage..." aria-label="Search destinations"><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Find trips <span>↗</span></button></form></div></section>
<section class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">FIND YOUR KIND OF GETAWAY</div><h2>Journeys for every <em>kind of you.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/packages">View all packages <span>↗</span></a></div>
<div class="category-grid">
  <a class="category-tile" href="/packages?category=Hill%20Station%20Holidays" style="--tile-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1626621341517-bbf3d9990a23?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80')"><span>01</span><strong>Mountain escapes</strong><small>Fresh air, fresh perspective ↗</small></a>
  <a class="category-tile" href="/packages?category=Beach%20Holidays" style="--tile-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512343879784-a960bf40e7f2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80')"><span>02</span><strong>Coastal days</strong><small>Slow down by the sea ↗</small></a>
  <a class="category-tile" href="/pilgrimage-tours" style="--tile-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1561361513-2d000a50f0dc?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80')"><span>03</span><strong>Soulful journeys</strong><small>Pilgrimage & heritage ↗</small></a>
  <a class="category-tile" href="/packages?category=Family%20Holidays" style="--tile-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1476514525535-07fb3b4ae5f1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80')"><span>04</span><strong>Family time</strong><small>Memories made together ↗</small></a>
</div></section>
<section class="section section-soft"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">THE PLACES THAT STAY WITH YOU</div><h2>Explore India, <em>one region at a time.</em></h2><p class="section-intro">A country of many worlds. Pick a place that speaks to you and we'll help with the details.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/destinations">All destinations ↗</a></div>
<div class="destination-grid"><% destinations.forEach((d,i)=>{ %><a class="destination-card" href="/destinations/<%= d.slug %>"><img src="<%= d.image %>" alt="<%= d.name %>" loading="lazy"><span class="destination-shade"></span><span class="destination-index"><%= String(i+1).padStart(2,'0') %> / INDIA</span><div class="destination-info"><small><%= d.region %></small><h3><%= d.name %></h3><span>Explore region ↗</span></div></a><% }) %></div>
</div></section>
<section class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">TRIP IDEAS TO GET YOU GOING</div><h2>Popular ways to <em>get away.</em></h2><p class="section-intro">Start with an idea. We'll tailor the details to your dates, pace and budget.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/packages">Browse all trips ↗</a></div>
<div class="package-grid"><% featured.forEach(p=>{ %><%- include('partials/package-card',{p}) %><% }) %></div></section>
<section class="pilgrimage-band"><div class="wrap pilgrimage-inner"><div><div class="eyebrow light-eyebrow">TRAVEL WITH MEANING</div><h2>Journeys that bring<br><em>you closer to what matters.</em></h2><p>Explore pilgrimage and heritage routes across India with thoughtful planning and clear, confirmed travel details.</p><a class="btn btn-light" href="/pilgrimage-tours">Explore pilgrimage tours ↗</a></div><div class="pilgrimage-art"><span class="art-orbit orbit-one"></span><span class="art-orbit orbit-two"></span><span class="art-sun">✦</span><span class="art-word">meaning<br><em>in every mile.</em></span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wrap"><div class="custom-cta"><div class="cta-decoration">JM</div><div><div class="eyebrow">YOUR TRIP, YOUR RULES</div><h2>Have something different<br>in mind? <em>Let's plan it.</em></h2><p>Share the places you dream about, your travel dates and who’s coming along. We'll help shape a trip around you.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/custom-trip">Build my trip <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="cta-side"><span>01 /</span><strong>Tell us what<br>you love.</strong><span>02 /</span><strong>We shape your<br>journey.</strong><span>03 /</span><strong>You get ready<br>to explore.</strong></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-soft"><div class="wrap faq-layout"><div><div class="eyebrow">A FEW THINGS TO KNOW</div><h2>Good to know<br><em>before you go.</em></h2><p>Travel planning should feel simple. Here are a few quick answers.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact">Still have a question? Contact us ↗</a></div><div class="faq-list"><% faqs.forEach(f=>{ %><details><summary><%= f.question %><span>＋</span></summary><p><%= f.answer %></p></details><% }) %></div></div></section>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
